  "stem": "A rectangular courtyard is \\(2x\\) meters long and \\(x + 3\\) meters wide. A square fountain with side length \\(x\\) meters is built inside the courtyard, as shown. The part of the courtyard outside the fountain is paved and has an area of 91 square meters. What is the value of \\(x\\)?",
